nd enemy types. Test your skills in the toughest battles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3889960/extras/3fd98bf6f8b4e18bd1205b02811ac945.webp?t=1788971736\" width=1172 height=39 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3889960/extras/bba27d04bba5f485bb931455dbc22a02.avif?t=1788971736\" width=360 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3889960/extras/8bf00837a72062635c9bc529a7ecaac5.poster.avif?t=1788971736\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3889960/extras/8bf00837a72062635c9bc529a7ecaac5.webm?t=1788971736\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3889960/extras/8bf00837a72062635c9bc529a7ecaac5.mp4?t=1788971736\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every update brings new challenges, exclusive rewards, and themed content — from major PvP events to solo and co-op PvE missions. Prove your skills, earn epic rewards, and come back for more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3889960/extras/3fd98bf6f8b4e18bd1205b02811ac945.webp?t=1788971736\" width=1172 height=39 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3889960/extras/cd32c3e9da5042f229a4566528b5038f.avif?t=1788971736\" width=617 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video c