, and showcase rare achievements on your profile.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3889960/extras/3fd98bf6f8b4e18bd1205b02811ac945.webp?t=1788971736\" width=1172 height=39 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3889960/extras/9791505f20f5bedc0e6341eb13b0b2a1.avif?t=1788971736\" width=587 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3889960/extras/6302e5e2870325fff14376c7ccf80afe.poster.avif?t=1788971736\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3889960/extras/6302e5e2870325fff14376c7ccf80afe.webm?t=1788971736\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3889960/extras/6302e5e2870325fff14376c7ccf80afe.mp4?t=1788971736\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Eye-catching knife animations keep the action going even between matches.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3889960/extras/3fd98bf6f8b4e18bd1205b02811ac945.webp?t=1788971736\" width=1172 height=39 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3889960/extras/72dec0865f79f8ff86781b4cb2ae4131.avif?t=1788971736\" width=521 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3889960/extras/f68ca2a13b961bb07ff3e9b27a1131eb.poster.avif?t=1788971736\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3889960/extras/f68ca2a13b961bb07ff3e9b27a1131eb.webm?t=1788971736\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3889960/extras/f68ca2a13b961bb07ff3e9b27a1131eb.mp4?t=1788971736\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Team up with friends, compete in tournaments, find a squad, and connect with other players on social media. Warface is more than just a game — it's a community.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3889960/extras/3fd98bf6f8b4e18bd1205b02811ac945.webp?t=1788971736\" width=1172 height=39 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3889960/extras/410700f6f30971f0727b82e29a055574.avif?t=1788971736\" width=548 height=100 /></span></p>",
        "short_description": "Warface is a tactical team-based shooter featuring four classes, 14 PvP modes, and engaging PvE missions. Join millions of players, build and customize your arsenal from over 300 weapons, and claim victory with your team. Fight hard!",
